OL,3,GNEWSAFood firm offers help after 600
OL,4,Ajobs lost at Kanes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA food company has offered support to
OL,7,Fstaff at a nearby business that has
OL,8,Fgone into administration.
OL,10,FKanes Foods Limited, which supplies
OL,11,Fmajor UK supermarkets with pre-packaged
OL,12,Fsalads, stir-fry products and sauces,
OL,13,Fcollapsed on Tuesday with the loss of
OL,14,F600 jobs.
OL,16,FAdministrators PwC said the company in
OL,17,FEvesham had faced "significant
OL,18,Ffinancial and operational challenges"
OL,19,Fover the last few years.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
