OL,3,GNEWSAFood firm offers help after 600
OL,4,Ajobs lost at Kanes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrimafruit, which is based at Vale
OL,7,FBusiness Park, said it would host a
OL,8,Fdrop-in morning on Friday "for anyone
OL,9,Faffected who may be looking for work".
